#!grafli v1
# {{Title}} — reveal storyboard
# Companion board to paper.md. Purpose: {{purpose}} — so this board is a
# STORYBOARD: one node per beat, in reveal order, mirroring the guided flow
# in Sandbox.qml exactly (same order, same vocabulary). Started {{date}}.
#
# Skeleton. Replace every "…" with the real thing. If the flow gains or
# loses a step, this board changes in the same commit - the flow is the
# primary artifact and this is its map.

# ── entry ──
@ box paper "Paper →\nthe lesson plan" 60,60 220x80 %soft &link:./paper.md
@ note legend 900,60 """
press T in the lab
this board is that tour
""" ~small

# ── what they arrive with ──
@ box belief "THE BELIEF THEY ARRIVE WITH\n…" 60,230 300x130 %accent &link:./paper.md#the-misconception-it-targets

# ── the beats, in reveal order ──
@ box beat1 "1 …\nscenario: intro\nflow step: intro" 440,220 260x130 %primary &link:./paper.md#the-demonstration-sequence
@ box beat2 "2 …\nthey act\nflow step: try" 440,400 260x130 %teal &link:./paper.md#the-demonstration-sequence
@ box beat3 "3 …\nflow step: check" 440,580 260x130 %primary &link:./paper.md#the-demonstration-sequence

# ── the moment ──
@ box moment "THE NUMBER THAT CONTRADICTS IT\n… lands on …" 780,400 280x140 %rose &link:./paper.md#the-moment-the-number-contradicts-the-belief

# ── the takeaway ──
@ box takeaway "the takeaway\n\"…\"" 780,620 280x120 %highlight &link:./paper.md#the-takeaway

# ── arrows ──
@ arrow belief -> beat1 "start here"
@ arrow beat1 -> beat2
@ arrow beat2 -> beat3
@ arrow beat3 -> moment
@ arrow moment -> takeaway
@ arrow moment -> belief "revises" !dashed

# ── the lab itself ──
@ note scen 60,470 """
scenarios (keys 1-2)
1 intro - …
2 … - …
""" ~small &link:./paper.md#the-demonstration-sequence

@ note keys 60,660 """
keys
1-2 presets · T tour · Space next · ← back
F frame · 0 reset · Shift+R record · ? all
""" ~small &link:./paper.md#how-to-run-it
